Subject: [PATCH RFC] dt-bindings: input: hid-over-spi: identify MSHW0484

MSHW0484 on the Denali LCD board uses a distinct opcode pair and
reset/shutdown timing. Describe its hardware ID independently of the
generic G6 compatible. The captured Windows inventory identifies ACPI
MSHW0484 revision 1; association with SSDT GTCH is documented as an
inference.

This is an unbuilt binding proposal on spi-hid v7 for the disabled board
draft and MSHW0484 protocol/sequencing RFC. Independent cross-check
remains outstanding.

Assisted-by: Codex gpt-6.1-sol
---
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/hid-over-spi.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/hid-over-spi.yaml
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/hid-over-spi.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/hid-over-spi.yaml
@@ -27,6 +27,7 @@
   compatible:
     enum:
       - microsoft,g6-touch-digitizer
+      - microsoft,mshw0484
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
